cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use openmc2donjon in academic work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: openmc2donjon
abstract: >-
  openmc2donjon bridges OpenMC and DRAGON/DONJON for production
  homogenization workflows. It exports OpenMC statepoints, optionally
  augments the resulting MGXS HDF5 with ADF/DF or OpenMC-side SPH
  equivalence factors, and converts the handoff
  into L_MULTICOMPO or L_MACROLIB ASCII files consumed by DONJON
  low-order solves.
version: "0.1.2"
date-released: "2026-05-19"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/arbreCui/openmc2donjon"
url: "https://github.com/arbreCui/openmc2donjon"
authors:
